{
  "inventory": "Pakistan road transport (1.A.3.b) and off-road machinery (1.A.4.c ii)",
  "reference_year": "2024 = FY2023-24, the common reference period; petrol/diesel controls OCAC FY2023-24 Road rows. Two SHAPES are borrowed because the reference period does not carry them: the class split rides the 2023 registration panel (2024 reports 30 percent of the best-covered year) and the provincial split rides the FY2024-25 monthly area pages (FY2023-24 has one month, not twelve). Neither moves a tonne - see outputs/transport_provincial_shape_brackets.csv. Generator carve-out HIES 2024-25; rail cross-check now year-matched.",
  "control_totals": "petrol 7209.4 kt/yr (Road MS+HOBC) and HSD 5551.4 kt/yr (Road row), OCAC Sectoral Sales FY2023-24; CNG 62 MMCFD FY2023-24 (OGRA Tables 3.31/6.1)",
  "methods": {
    "ghg": "IPCC 2006 Vol 2 Ch 3 Tier 1, fuel-anchored: Table 3.2.1/3.2.2 road, Table 3.3.1 off-road; CNG on OGRA metered gas",
